Package: ebdt
Title: Evaluation of Binary Diagnostic Tests
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
      given = "Miguel",
      family = "Montalbán",
      email = "migmontal@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-XXXX-XXXX")
    )
Description: Provides comprehensive tools for evaluating binary diagnostic tests,
    including calculation of sensitivity, specificity, accuracy, predictive values,
    likelihood ratios, and other performance metrics. The package enables 
    visualization of ROC curves and confusion matrices, and supports both 
    single test evaluation and comparison of multiple diagnostic tests.
